                <l xml:id="m-6bc3f0f8-e2cb-4882-bd8b-8a98e6ef7b97" facs="#m-46a0b78e-0b19-4ebf-a694-78f363167ca8" label="text-like">Sunday within the Octave of the Ascension.</l><l xml:id="m-9c138385-3517-4731-ac30-a715e43585e6" facs="#m-81b64900-fccc-4402-bd48-0e5a88c8a692" label="ambiguous">857</l><l xml:id="m-8b31188f-412d-4bd3-acf7-f6c1f6768efe" facs="#m-116d521c-9dde-4ecd-a928-50cdacd15369" label="lyrics-like">bam é-os, quos dedísti mí-hi,</l><l xml:id="m-d69df385-e66e-42ed-b1e5-1155c345cc31" facs="#m-159e4109-fc40-46cc-9ab0-e0b23b32745c" label="ambiguous">alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-5e07be8d-9fc3-4890-8785-46a395aa3354" facs="#m-b69389db-78b0-45a8-9f1d-7861af7616e1" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia : nunc</l><l xml:id="m-d73b363f-3cf2-4b3c-b501-98ed7fce7b3b" facs="#m-4827186d-380e-4b0a-b422-d5a9aeca6bde" label="lyrics-like">au-tem ad te vé-ni- non ró-go ut tóllas é-os de</l><l xml:id="m-4cfb535c-a138-4146-9d12-befb9e3c56b0" facs="#m-26ca0b1b-bc9d-482d-a4d2-5a196ca80a23" label="lyrics-like">mún- do, sed ut sérves é¬ os a má-lo,</l><l xml:id="m-644055c4-1aa6-4215-95aa-bc90d96aea4f" facs="#m-82f6c827-2e23-4068-9b1b-2484ddebd1c7" label="lyrics-like">alle-lú-ia,</l><l xml:id="m-67ae29d5-c48a-4b0d-a60d-0e4b0be67944" facs="#m-6f399640-7b49-433b-ad99-bff0deb5e714" label="ambiguous">al¬</l><l xml:id="m-4ec84040-7ef1-4bc8-9bde-d3216c9b4227" facs="#m-a63f9fa9-1724-4d1c-934e-a0c64c77ba3e" label="lyrics-like">le- lú- ia.</l><l xml:id="m-2ecf2c09-6448-4d07-a4db-dbfd2b9ad156" facs="#m-d08b4b99-c94a-4021-9531-6408298a19a5" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-1971dd50-9ea4-44d1-bce8-184f53bca1a0" facs="#m-4f522d53-8c51-4efe-9e87-fd67c005b835" label="lyrics-like">Epléti, Dómine, munéribus sa- tiárum semper actióne maneámus.</l><l xml:id="m-e3dbcfda-b5fc-4437-b9a5-5c8130df2fcb" facs="#m-ab6deeaa-9186-4acd-a3e9-8560d2f4b3d4" label="lyrics-like">At cris; da, quaésumus:ut in gra-l Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-b3614a7e-6606-4c2c-b0b3-2658178db477" facs="#m-097e0045-79b1-490d-bfd5-6bafa7624cc1" label="text-like">Commemoration of the Octave of the Ascension. Postcommanton. Praesta</l><l xml:id="m-6d175894-f4f9-49fe-94dc-0492400380fa" facs="#m-fb1f09db-0cc0-46a3-8ef1-0845bbf3c9eb" label="ambiguous">nobis. p. 849.</l><l xml:id="m-e1391d99-5315-472f-a8dc-c54138a4c8fe" facs="#m-f6887fce-d1c0-4cfd-ad19-079ec07907da" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-24b44517-5725-4f68-a923-e03b531dc72c" facs="#m-ffd7e455-91a9-4b58-85fb-cdd76251e1c5" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Elevátis mánibus. p. 851.</l><l xml:id="m-17c016d8-8612-456a-b34c-b4aabb92ad10" facs="#m-22ef739d-45df-42af-883d-7cb2754045e2" label="ambiguous">1. Pet. 4. b.</l><l xml:id="m-2a005d6e-eadf-4661-a4d1-cd890e4d39f2" facs="#m-1f06eff5-fb18-4c72-b0c5-68996f6579e7" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-8da24efa-4e37-4ab0-ab92-b0bbbf14c7b8" facs="#m-28f31080-9b05-4bd8-97b7-8447e133ab8e" label="lyrics-like">zOspitáles invicem sine murmu-]administrántes, “ sicut boni dispen¬</l><l xml:id="m-affd8eb0-c47a-44ef-95f7-5a41d7b3539c" facs="#m-10011ac4-0ba2-44f3-9c0f-9cb9bfcf6edd" label="lyrics-like">It ratióne: t unusquisque, sicut</l><l xml:id="m-93690f4b-8808-4158-a660-bb162b63c579" facs="#m-bb448300-9774-4cbd-a7ed-a9c287182961" label="lyrics-like">satóres multifórmis grátiae Dei.</l><l xml:id="m-4501ed8c-8b0f-4067-8c7c-b023140749b1" facs="#m-58d70384-aeed-4b83-98c8-26f67c40f7f9" label="lyrics-like">accépit grátiam, in altérutrum illam!</l><l xml:id="m-83bd6ec3-7532-4688-9f2b-39f0e965083a" facs="#m-b84f7d46-031c-41f3-aea8-45fb3b4803f7" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Ascéndens Christus. 850.</l><l xml:id="m-96adb79e-a730-427c-b6ec-eda3331db76c" facs="#m-bc7a9983-f5c0-4389-a691-913a45867811" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-6a61babc-9aa5-4876-8413-b0a08c088a2c" facs="#m-c1036203-3031-445f-bde0-84dee768f649" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Vidéntibus illis. p. 851.</l><l xml:id="m-13283699-84b0-405a-92ed-636fbab7326e" facs="#m-c6e4e65c-c685-4b97-9e70-7eaff712bece" label="ambiguous">1. Pet. 4. c.</l><l xml:id="m-461f465b-bd77-4e5e-9cf7-5479085b405c" facs="#m-b62c5699-5b0d-4b96-af66-525eeb48ee6e" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-f694d31c-9303-4aea-bb48-c63705e502ab" facs="#m-0c78a93b-d79e-4030-91e9-ea16c80fef78" label="lyrics-like">1 quis lóquitur, quasi sermónes! Deus:* ut in ómnibus honorificétur</l><l xml:id="m-fab075b2-81c3-4782-a18e-5b249e147ab1" facs="#m-4dfb0c03-8812-4ec3-a673-8257ad122335" label="lyrics-like">DDei:t si quis ministrat, tam-(Deus per Jesum Christum Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-dbe5dbf0-7653-4fc6-9791-8b9353a0fe3b" facs="#m-3df6eba5-8e98-44ce-8bcc-6c4e3e411f5e" label="lyrics-like">quam ex virtúte quam adminístrat ! nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-e42869d2-ee86-46e6-810c-02c8dc58301c" facs="#m-b285ac75-cb3f-4f1a-a5c7-0adfaf263f1a" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Ascéndo ad Pâtrem méum. p. 850.</l><l xml:id="m-e8c4dda6-04c5-4a8e-8e58-1710652a217e" facs="#m-53b3e0f3-d162-45c2-b22e-ea8f2e862ec2" label="text-like">AT SECOND VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-f32995cf-1c5d-44b1-a30a-21a4bfe3bae7" facs="#m-efceab2b-68e5-428f-adab-aee2d5870581" label="text-like">All as on Ascension day, p. 850, except the following:</l><l xml:id="m-09f41ca8-26be-4fe8-b5cd-5d64d434b702" facs="#m-e18f5724-b971-440b-a886-701a5d61641c" label="ambiguous">r. Pet. 4. b.</l><l xml:id="m-b73ac525-530d-464f-83f8-060df7b07c26" facs="#m-5c8dcac8-7693-41a0-9d5d-63766695ca93" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-42593af1-fb0b-4068-be27-5b2a5e2b2d12" facs="#m-ffa5f717-f7ab-4204-8470-4e0d2243017b" label="lyrics-like">vArissimi: Estóte prudéntes, et! metípsis caritátem contínuam ha¬</l><l xml:id="m-8c15ade8-da4f-4e9c-82d9-ff507b14d89e" facs="#m-fff87f3f-9e85-4cc4-bed2-dbde0f3fe36b" label="lyrics-like">L vigiláte in oratiónibus. t Ante béntes :* quia cáritas óperit multi¬</l><l xml:id="m-aff545ea-e99e-41bb-8e20-c6eef18ed59a" facs="#m-ef0b0535-e91d-412d-8098-203b3d1104d7" label="lyrics-like">ómnia autem, mútuam in vobis-l túdinem peccatórum.</l></lg>
